{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"capacity"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cut","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DirectedView","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedView","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols12DirectedViewV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">? "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AdditiveArithmetic","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Comparable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The cut minimizes the capacity of the edges between a nonempty proper vertex set and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rest. The side holding the first vertex is the source side. Computed by Nagamochi–Ibaraki:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"maximum adjacency orderings that contract every edge whose scanned connection is at least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the best cut so far. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same input always gives the same cut.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the edges of positive capacity do not connect the graph, the result is the cut of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value zero whose source side is the first vertex’s component, with every crossing edge.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Parallel capacities add and self-loops are ignored. ","type":"text"},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is called once per non-loop","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge, in position order, before any work.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" where needed ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int128"},{"type":"text","text":" for fixed-width"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a contracted group’s connection may exceed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":"’s range."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(nm log n) in the worst case."}]}],"name":"Complexity","type":"aside"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" (it is at most every vertex’s capacity sum)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumCut(capacity:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A global minimum cut over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directedView"},{"type":"text","text":", or nil below two vertices."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/flows\/graphprotocols\/graph\/minimumcut(capacity:)"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5FlowsE10minimumCut8capacityAD0E0VyAA12DirectedViewVyxGqd__GSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"name":"Flows","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"title":"minimumCut(capacity:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"capacity"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","kind":"typeIden